+
+Wasmer serves the committed demo files as a static site (the root `Staticfile` sets `root: .`, so no Node/Gulp build runs); the login and register pages are static demo screens without a real sign-in. The button opens Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the configuration and click Deploy; it does not create a copy of the repository in your GitHub account. To customize the template and redeploy on every push, fork this repository and import your fork on Wasmer.
